    <div class="fn-text">
      Total dilution = ( <span class="underline">options outstanding + shares available for grant </span>)<br>
      <span style="margin-left:20px;">(total shares outstanding + options outstanding + shares available for grant)</span>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="footnote-line">
    <div class="fn-num">(3)</div>
    <div class="fn-text">Net burn rate equals net options awarded divided by total shares outstanding.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="footnote-line">
    <div class="fn-num">(4)</div>
    <div class="fn-text">The numbers in this column do not include the approximately 9.7 million additional shares we are requesting.</div>
  </div>
